---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Us - 5 en 1" lang="en">
  <Header />
  <main class="py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-950 mb-6">About Us</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-neutral max-w-none">
        <p class="text-lg text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          The 5 en 1 Modern Pentathlon Club was founded with the aim of promoting and practicing modern pentathlon in Villanueva de la Cañada, Madrid.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          Our goal is to foster sport from the grassroots level, training athletes of all ages with values of effort, teamwork, and personal growth. We work on all five disciplines of modern pentathlon: fencing, swimming, riding, pistol shooting, and running.
        </p>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          Through dynamic training sessions adapted to each level, we aim for our athletes to enjoy the journey, improve day by day, and participate in regional and national competitions.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-brand-950 mt-8 mb-4">Our Philosophy</h2>
        <p class="text-neutral-700 mb-4">
          We believe in holistic training, mutual respect, and consistency. For us, the result is important, but the journey and each athlete's growth within the club matter even more.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
